              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "তথ্য — tôthyô — \"information; facts\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "এই তথ্যটা কি সত্যি? ei tôthyôṭā ki sôtti? Is this information true?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "তথ্য (tôthyô) is Sanskrit tathya, 'being really so', truth (Monier-Williams). Bengali uses it for facts and information, a modern use of the word."
            }
          ]
        },
