          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মেলানো — melāno — \"to match up; to check against\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সনদের নামটা তোমার পরিচয়পত্রের সঙ্গে মেলাও। sônôder nāmṭā tomār pôrichôypôtrer sôngge melāo. Check the name on the certificate against your identity card."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি নামগুলো মেলালেন, tini nāmgulo melālen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মেলানো (melāno) is the causative of মেলা 'to meet, to tally', of the family of Sanskrit milana, meeting (CDIAL 10134 lists Bengali milan): to make two things meet and see whether they agree. The second thing takes -এর সঙ্গে."
            }
          ]
        },
